OL,3,GNEWSARichard Hammond to 'find a way' to
OL,4,Ashare mansion with bats after
OL,5,Arenovation plans paused
OL,6,
OL,7,FFormer Top Gear star Richard Hammond
OL,8,Fhas said he'll "find a way" of sharing
OL,9,Fhis new #2m home in Wales with bats
OL,10,Ffound foraging in the grounds.
OL,12,FThe 56-year-old bought the 19th Century
OL,13,FGeorgian mansion in Llanwenarth, near
OL,14,FAbergavenny, in November 2025.
OL,16,FBut plans to add a padel court and
OL,17,Fluxury car garage hit the brakes after
OL,18,Fa survey found several species of bats,
OL,19,Fincluding the common pipistrelle and
OL,20,Fsoprano pipistrelles.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
